Package: px4-ifd
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, pcscd
Suggests: px4-drv-dkms
Provides: pcsc-ifd-handler
Description: PC/SC IFD handler for px4_drv built-in smart card readers
 This pcscd plugin provides access to built-in smart card readers through
 the card device nodes exposed by the px4_drv kernel driver.
 A version of px4_drv with built-in card reader support is required.
